{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922002443_2e49a7b9","chunk_index":19,"job_id":"mwjob_bf28987c132c1b13527f252a","precondition_digest":"67d537499c47fe4ae0d786ec4ac18714b2af7d64fc584e8f1b34e1d9f712899a","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v5","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922002443_2e49a7b9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04\n章节编号=12.1\n章节标题=研究方案的依从","quote_sha256":"362c30777030557f3245e24774bb07b38780aee358d09fd16a4e3a9a4bb5cf81","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","span_id":"span_sel_4106"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_visit_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_adherence"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_gcp_compliance"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","quote":"根据 GCP 要求，未经申办者和 EC 的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床 试验管理方面的改动。","quote_sha256":"76042946d5684aaa9636ba63055710074755cd90e1cbcdea361b478c726f510b","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","span_id":"span_deviation_rule"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_4106","span_study_visit_strategy","span_study_adherence","span_gcp_compliance","span_deviation_rule"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"研究方案的依从","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的实施应严格遵循经伦理委员会批准的试验方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）以及其他适用的法律法规。研究者及其研究团队应按照经批准的试验方案实施研究访视，包括筛选后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访，并于基线及第4、8、12、16周完成PASI和sPGA评价。试验组和对照组的治疗依从性均通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。未经申办者和伦理委员会同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但为及时消除对受试者的紧急危害而采取的必要措施除外；此类紧急情况应按适用要求及时记录和报告。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究事实中的访视策略、PASI和sPGA评价时间点及用药依从性评价方式，并结合监管共性GCP依从要求，支持本章节正文。医学作者需核对伦理委员会批准版本、紧急偏离记录与报告路径以及用药依从性评价的具体记录载体。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04","section_number":"12.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922002443_2e49a7b9","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","fact_path":"design.center_model","options":[{"label":"基于风险的监查","option_id":"risk_based","summary":"结合中心入组速度、数据质量、方案依从性和受试者安全风险，确定监查范围、频次和关注重点，不固定统一访视频率。"},{"label":"定期现场监查","option_id":"periodic_onsite","summary":"对各中心按预设周期开展现场监查，覆盖知情同意、数据溯源、药品管理和安全性报告等模块。"},{"label":"中心化监查","option_id":"centralized","summary":"以中心化数据审核为主，结合触发式现场监查，适用于数据质量稳定、风险较低的中心。"}],"question":"本研究应采用何种监查方式，并如何在监查安排中明确频次、记录和发现处理流程？","rationale":"当前项目为多中心设计，监查资源配置需与中心数量和数据质量相匹配；推荐以基于风险的监查作为待确认方案，具体频次和记录要求由医学作者与临床运营确认。","recommended_option_id":"risk_based"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f\n章节编号=12.2\n章节标题=监查","quote_sha256":"60bbaee566a9c11f0ed1733b68751cfcf64e8f2d0969f8b1f7e2dccc0c96d96e","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","span_id":"span_sel_5bce"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我将根据中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"span_monitoring_access"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","quote":"临床研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究 方案的培训，使每个参研人员都对临床研究方案及其各指标具体内涵有充分理解和认识、掌握 GCP 原则、统一记录方式与判断标准、严格按照方案执行。培训必须在该临床试验机构入选受试者之前进行。","quote_sha256":"a668438495209c1a93ff8056f3ef958a45b23c7f699057c8114de2ccc026a93e","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","span_id":"span_training"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_multicenter"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_5bce","span_monitoring_access","span_training","span_study_multicenter"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"监查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"监查应按照适用的GCP要求组织实施，目的在于核实研究中心对经伦理委员会批准的试验方案、GCP及适用法律法规的依从性，核实研究数据的真实性、准确性和完整性，并确认受试者的安全和权益得到保护。鉴于本研究为多中心研究，监查应覆盖各参与中心。监查的具体方式、频次、记录要求、发现分级及处理流程应在监查相关文件中明确。","rationale":"当前项目为多中心研究，监查需覆盖各参与中心；监管共性要求研究实施接受监查和检查。当前项目来源未规定监查方式、频次、记录模板和发现处理流程，医学作者需与临床运营和质量团队确认后形成既定监查安排。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","section_number":"12.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922002443_2e49a7b9","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","fact_path":"design.center_model","options":[{"label":"基于风险的稽查","option_id":"risk_triggered_audit","summary":"根据中心入组量、数据质量、方案依从性和既往检查结果确定稽查中心与稽查范围。"},{"label":"常规计划稽查","option_id":"routine_audit","summary":"按预设中心抽样和周期安排稽查，覆盖知情同意、数据溯源、安全性报告和药品管理。"},{"label":"核查准备为主","option_id":"inspection_readiness_only","summary":"不另行安排申办者稽查，重点开展监管核查前资料准备和现场配合。"}],"question":"本项目的稽查与监管核查应按何种范围、启动条件和整改跟踪方式执行？","rationale":"当前项目来源未规定稽查范围、启动条件、通知方式和整改跟踪流程；推荐以基于风险的稽查作为待确认方案，具体安排由医学作者与质量保证团队确认。","recommended_option_id":"risk_triggered_audit"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952\n章节编号=12.3\n章节标题=稽查和核查","quote_sha256":"b5f99867c032412c21ba58501109c6484117808c577c42c6be1d22b1a4327e03","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","span_id":"span_sel_6dac"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我将根据中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"span_monitoring_access"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_multicenter"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_gcp_compliance"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_6dac","span_monitoring_access","span_study_multicenter","span_gcp_compliance"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"稽查和核查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"稽查和核查是研究质量保证的重要活动。研究者和研究中心应配合申办者组织的稽查以及药品监督管理部门的核查，提供研究记录、相关设施和人员访问，保证所提供信息的真实性和完整性。稽查或核查中发现的与方案依从、数据质量或受试者安全相关的问题，应按照适用要求进行记录、评估和整改。鉴于本研究为多中心研究，稽查和核查可能涉及各参与中心。具体的稽查范围、启动条件、通知方式和整改跟踪流程应在稽查相关文件中明确。","rationale":"监管共性要求研究者配合申办者稽查和药品监督管理部门核查，当前项目为多中心设计。当前项目来源未规定稽查范围、启动条件、通知方式和整改跟踪流程，医学作者需与质量保证团队确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","section_number":"12.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922002443_2e49a7b9","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc","fact_path":"picos.assessment_timing_restrictions","options":[{"label":"风险分级联合报告","option_id":"hybrid_risk_based","summary":"按偏离对受试者安全、权益和数据完整性的影响进行风险分级，重大偏离及时报告，轻微偏离定期汇总。"},{"label":"按研究中心SOP与法规报告","option_id":"site_sop_aligned","summary":"由研究中心按照所属机构SOP、伦理委员会和监管要求对偏离进行分类、记录和报告。"},{"label":"按申办者统一分类报告","option_id":"sponsor_classification","summary":"由申办者提供统一偏离分类表和报告路径，研究中心按统一模板记录并报告。"}],"question":"本项目方案偏离的分类、报告时限、报告对象和纠正预防措施应如何确定？","rationale":"当前项目来源仅明确未经申办者和伦理委员会同意不得修改或偏离方案，并保留紧急危害例外；偏离分类、时限、对象和纠正预防措施流程需医学作者与伦理、质量和临床运营确认。","recommended_option_id":"hybrid_risk_based"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc\n章节编号=12.4\n章节标题=方案偏离","quote_sha256":"566541f852e618e250a204c720dce56c54afa98f0c5e85d6b030e8b5c5bfb7bf","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","span_id":"span_sel_8d71"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","quote":"根据 GCP 要求，未经申办者和 EC 的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床 试验管理方面的改动。","quote_sha256":"76042946d5684aaa9636ba63055710074755cd90e1cbcdea361b478c726f510b","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","span_id":"span_deviation_rule"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_gcp_compliance"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_visit_strategy"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_8d71","span_deviation_rule","span_gcp_compliance","span_study_visit_strategy"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"方案偏离","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"方案偏离是指研究实施过程中出现的任何偏离经伦理委员会批准的试验方案要求的情况。研究者应按照适用的GCP和法规要求识别、记录、评估和报告方案偏离，并采取适当的纠正和预防措施。除为及时消除对受试者的紧急危害外，未经申办者和伦理委员会同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案。对于为消除紧急危害而采取的必要偏离，应在采取措施后按照适用要求及时记录并报告。方案偏离的分类、报告时限、报告对象和后续处理流程应在项目相关文件中明确。","rationale":"监管共性要求未经申办者和伦理委员会同意不得修改或偏离方案，紧急危害例外需记录和报告；当前项目已明确访视和评价时间点。当前项目来源未规定偏离分类、报告时限、报告对象和纠正预防措施流程，医学作者需与伦理、质量和临床运营确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc","section_number":"12.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:6e7ee9d50564c3fe51082834","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"6b801a21cf7c158eeaec249bf45ccd3e21fb5e609cdbac4783c92230d3db3674"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"76042946d5684aaa9636ba63055710074755cd90e1cbcdea361b478c726f510b"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a668438495209c1a93ff8056f3ef958a45b23c7f699057c8114de2ccc026a93e"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd"}]}